       whereas it is considered as a double by [libgmp] because it is written in
       decimal expansion. In order to make [libgmp] consider it to be a rational,
-      it must be converted into "1/10". *)
+      it must be converted into "1/10". A constant with an exponent or in
+      hexadecimal notation is converted as well. *)
 
   val create:
     loc:Fileloc.t -> ?name:string -> term option ->  Env.t -> kernel_function ->
